                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.53.0"&gt;3.53.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Improve memory_load metric in .NET 10&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Reduce buffer contention when writing spans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Improve CODEOWNERS parsing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Continuous Profiling] Bug fixes and performance improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Feature Flagging] Send split serial ids on exposure events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid unobserved tasks for synchronous delegate exceptions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5181020456" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9071" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9071/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9071"&gt;#9071&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce locking in &lt;code&gt;AgentWriter&lt;/code&gt; to avoid contention (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5237185211" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9107" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9107/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9107"&gt;#9107&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expose the &lt;code&gt;TrailerSize&lt;/code&gt; of an &lt;code&gt;ISpanBufferSerializer&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5244825512" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9115" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9115/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9115"&gt;#9115&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix lock-contention causing trace to be "stranded" (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5247323098" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9120" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9120/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9120"&gt;#9120&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve &lt;code&gt;GcMemoryLoadCalculator&lt;/code&gt; by using &lt;code&gt;GC.GetConfigurationVariables()&lt;/code&gt; where possible (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5269536024" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9146" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9146/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9146"&gt;#9146&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Refactor CODEOWNERS parsing and source ownership resolution (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5223214534" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9099" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9099/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9099"&gt;#9099&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Fix coverage rewrites with shared framework dependencies (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5232985128" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9102" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9102/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9102"&gt;#9102&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Keep CODEOWNERS matches inside repository (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5256575230" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9127" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9127/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9127"&gt;#9127&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Stabilize CODEOWNERS concurrency test (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5268035367" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9143" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9143/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9143"&gt;#9143&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Resolve CODEOWNERS from matching local checkout (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5277582597" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9148" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9148/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9148"&gt;#9148&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
