&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] ManagedCodeCache updates synchronously (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4766747874" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8840" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8840/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8840"&gt;#8840&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix flaky tests caused by failing&lt;code&gt;timer_create&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5058637414" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8988" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8988/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8988"&gt;#8988&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
