&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Measure and reduce GC profiling impact (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5247267060" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9119" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9119/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9119"&gt;#9119&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix flacky tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5256172371" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9126" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9126/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9126"&gt;#9126&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix bug in FrameStore (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5265595718" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9140" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9140/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9140"&gt;#9140&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
